OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Swinney bats away 'yes or no'
OL,4,Aanswer on Rosebank oil field future
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney faced questions from
OL,7,Fopposition party leaders for the first
OL,8,Ftime since the October recess, with the
OL,9,Ffuture of Rosebank, an undeveloped oil
OL,10,Fand gas field, being brought up by
OL,11,Fseveral party leaders
OL,13,FMichael Marra, the Scottish Labour
OL,14,Fleader, Scottish Green co-leader Ross
OL,15,FGreer and Scottish Conservative leader
OL,16,FRussell Findlay pressed the FM on
OL,17,Fwhether he backed drilling at the North
OL,18,FSea location
OL,20,FFindlay used his Q&A slot to ask
OL,21,FSwinney five times whether he was "yes
OL,22,For no" for Rosebank
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
