OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Swinney bats away 'yes or no'
OL,4,Aanswer on Rosebank oil field future
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe FM did not offer a one-word answer,
OL,7,Finstead saying it was right there was
OL,8,Fcurrently a thorough assessment on
OL,9,Fcarbon emissions as the "journey to net
OL,10,Fzero" continues
